  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 955,
      "text": "Alif Lām Mīm Sād[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 956,
      "text": "This is a Book that has been sent down to you [O Prophet], so do not let your heart be troubled by it; so that you may warn thereby and as a reminder to the believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 957,
      "text": "Follow [O mankind] what has been sent down to you from your Lord, and do not follow any guardians besides Him. Little it is that you take heed!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 958,
      "text": "How many towns We have destroyed, and Our punishment came upon them at night or while they were taking midday rest.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 959,
      "text": "Their only cry, when Our punishment came upon them, was, “We were indeed wrongdoers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 960,
      "text": "So We will surely question those to whom the messengers were sent, and We will surely question the messengers themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 961,
      "text": "Then We will surely give them a full account [of their deeds] on the basis of knowledge, for We were never absent.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 962,
      "text": "The weighing [of deeds] on that Day will be true and just. Those whose scales [of good deeds] are heavy, it is they who will be successful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 963,
      "text": "But those whose scales are light, it is they who have lost their own souls, because they wrongfully rejected Our verses.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 964,
      "text": "We established you on earth and provided you with means of livelihood therein. Little do you give thanks.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 122,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 965,
      "text": "We surely created you, then shaped you, then We said to the angels, “Prostrate before Adam,” so they prostrated, except Iblīs [i.e., Satan], who was not one of those who prostrated[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 8,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 151,
      "ruku": 123,
      "hizbQuarter": 61,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
